{"id":"41289d25523036d5","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-albanese-map.md","title":"Albanese Map","display":"df-albanese-map — Albanese Map","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-albanese-map","aliases":["58-df-albanese-map","Albanese Map"],"display":"df-albanese-map — Albanese Map","depends_on":["[[58-df-abelian-variety]]","[[58-df-morphism]]","[[58-df-projective-variety]]","[[58-df-homomorphism]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-albanese-map"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-albanese-map</span><span>Albanese Map</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-albanese-map — Albanese Map"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bf0ad86f0f4cd75f\" href=\"?note=bf0ad86f0f4cd75f\" title=\"58-df-abelian-variety\">58-df-abelian-variety</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"610f23ee04365803\" href=\"?note=610f23ee04365803\" title=\"58-df-morphism\">58-df-morphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6046552157f71d9c\" href=\"?note=6046552157f71d9c\" title=\"58-df-projective-variety\">58-df-projective-variety</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f32a973b59a825e4\" href=\"?note=f32a973b59a825e4\" title=\"58-df-homomorphism\">58-df-homomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k,X,P_X,n_X,\\tau_X,A,B,m_A,i_A,e_A,m_B,i_B,e_B,\\mathcal C\\in V\">\\(k,X,P_X,n_X,\\tau_X,A,B,m_A,i_A,e_A,m_B,i_B,e_B,\\mathcal C\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProjectiveVariety}_S(X;P_X,k,n_X,\\tau_X)\">\\(\\operatorname{ProjectiveVariety}_S(X;P_X,k,n_X,\\tau_X)\\)</span> (projective-variety predicate with its ambient projective data, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6046552157f71d9c\" href=\"?note=6046552157f71d9c\" title=\"58-df-projective-variety\">58-df-projective-variety</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_0\\in X\">\\(x_0\\in X\\)</span> (basepoint)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AbelianVar}_S(k,A,m_A,i_A,e_A)\">\\(\\mathrm{AbelianVar}_S(k,A,m_A,i_A,e_A)\\)</span> (abelian-variety predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"bf0ad86f0f4cd75f\" href=\"?note=bf0ad86f0f4cd75f\" title=\"58-df-abelian-variety\">58-df-abelian-variety</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Morphism}_S(a,X,A,\\mathcal C)\">\\(\\mathrm{Morphism}_S(a,X,A,\\mathcal C)\\)</span> (morphism predicate with its category parameter, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"610f23ee04365803\" href=\"?note=610f23ee04365803\" title=\"58-df-morphism\">58-df-morphism</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (set-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GroupHomomorphism}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{GroupHomomorphism}_S\\)</span> (group-homomorphism predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"f32a973b59a825e4\" href=\"?note=f32a973b59a825e4\" title=\"58-df-homomorphism\">58-df-homomorphism</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AbelianVarHom}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{AbelianVarHom}_S\\)</span> (abelian-variety morphism predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AlbaneseMap}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{AlbaneseMap}_S\\)</span> (universal-map predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}albanese\\text{-}abelian\\text{-}morphism} \\vdash \\mathrm{AbelianVarHom}_S(h,k,A,m_A,i_A,e_A,B,m_B,i_B,e_B,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{AbelianVar}_S(k,A,m_A,i_A,e_A)\\land\\mathrm{AbelianVar}_S(k,B,m_B,i_B,e_B)\\land\\mathrm{Morphism}_S(h,A,B,\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(h,A,B)\\land\\mathrm{GroupHomomorphism}_S(h,A,m_A,B,m_B)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}albanese\\text{-}abelian\\text{-}morphism} \\vdash \\mathrm{AbelianVarHom}_S(h,k,A,m_A,i_A,e_A,B,m_B,i_B,e_B,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{AbelianVar}_S(k,A,m_A,i_A,e_A)\\land\\mathrm{AbelianVar}_S(k,B,m_B,i_B,e_B)\\land\\mathrm{Morphism}_S(h,A,B,\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(h,A,B)\\land\\mathrm{GroupHomomorphism}_S(h,A,m_A,B,m_B)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}albanese-map} \\vdash \\mathrm{AlbaneseMap}_S(k,X,P_X,n_X,\\tau_X,x_0,A,m_A,i_A,e_A,a,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{ProjectiveVariety}_S(X;P_X,k,n_X,\\tau_X)\\land x_0\\in X\\land\\mathrm{AbelianVar}_S(k,A,m_A,i_A,e_A)\\land\\mathrm{Morphism}_S(a,X,A,\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(a,X,A)\\land a(x_0)=e_A\\land\\forall B,m_B,i_B,e_B,f\\;\\left((\\mathrm{AbelianVar}_S(k,B,m_B,i_B,e_B)\\land\\mathrm{Morphism}_S(f,X,B,\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,B)\\land f(x_0)=e_B)\\to\\exists!h\\;(\\mathrm{AbelianVarHom}_S(h,k,A,m_A,i_A,e_A,B,m_B,i_B,e_B,\\mathcal C)\\land f=h\\circ a)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}albanese-map} \\vdash \\mathrm{AlbaneseMap}_S(k,X,P_X,n_X,\\tau_X,x_0,A,m_A,i_A,e_A,a,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{ProjectiveVariety}_S(X;P_X,k,n_X,\\tau_X)\\land x_0\\in X\\land\\mathrm{AbelianVar}_S(k,A,m_A,i_A,e_A)\\land\\mathrm{Morphism}_S(a,X,A,\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(a,X,A)\\land a(x_0)=e_A\\land\\forall B,m_B,i_B,e_B,f\\;\\left((\\mathrm{AbelianVar}_S(k,B,m_B,i_B,e_B)\\land\\mathrm{Morphism}_S(f,X,B,\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,B)\\land f(x_0)=e_B)\\to\\exists!h\\;(\\mathrm{AbelianVarHom}_S(h,k,A,m_A,i_A,e_A,B,m_B,i_B,e_B,\\mathcal C)\\land f=h\\circ a)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The ambient projective space, its dimension parameter, and the chosen Zariski topology are explicit because they are truth-relevant arguments of the upstream projective-variety predicate.</li>\n<li>The Albanese map is characterized by this pointed universal property and its target is unique up to unique isomorphism; smoothness or connectedness may be imposed separately when proving existence.</li>\n<li>For a compact Riemann surface, an analytic model is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H^0(X,\\Omega^1)^*/H_1(X,\\mathbb Z)\">\\(H^0(X,\\Omega^1)^*/H_1(X,\\mathbb Z)\\)</span>; the earlier formula reversed the quotient and incorrectly presented that curve-specific model as the general definition.</li>\n<li>For a smooth projective curve, the Albanese variety agrees with its Jacobian.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Hartshorne, Algebraic Geometry</li>\n<li>Mumford, Curves and Their Jacobians</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-abelian-variety","status":"resolved","id":"bf0ad86f0f4cd75f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-abelian-variety]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"610f23ee04365803","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-morphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-projective-variety","status":"resolved","id":"6046552157f71d9c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-projective-variety]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-homomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"f32a973b59a825e4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-homomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-projective-variety","status":"resolved","id":"6046552157f71d9c","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ProjectiveVariety}_S(X;P_X,k,n_X,\\tau_X)$ (projective-variety predicate with its ambient projective data, see [[58-df-projective-variety]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-abelian-variety","status":"resolved","id":"bf0ad86f0f4cd75f","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AbelianVar}_S(k,A,m_A,i_A,e_A)$ (abelian-variety predicate, see [[58-df-abelian-variety]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"610f23ee04365803","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Morphism}_S(a,X,A,\\mathcal C)$ (morphism predicate with its category parameter, see [[58-df-morphism]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (set-function predicate, see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-homomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"f32a973b59a825e4","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GroupHomomorphism}_S$ (group-homomorphism predicate, see [[58-df-homomorphism]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k,X,P_X,n_X,\\tau_X,A,B,m_A,i_A,e_A,m_B,i_B,e_B,\\mathcal C\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ProjectiveVariety}_S(X;P_X,k,n_X,\\tau_X)","display":false},{"tex":"x_0\\in X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AbelianVar}_S(k,A,m_A,i_A,e_A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Morphism}_S(a,X,A,\\mathcal C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GroupHomomorphism}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AbelianVarHom}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AlbaneseMap}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}albanese\\text{-}abelian\\text{-}morphism} \\vdash \\mathrm{AbelianVarHom}_S(h,k,A,m_A,i_A,e_A,B,m_B,i_B,e_B,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{AbelianVar}_S(k,A,m_A,i_A,e_A)\\land\\mathrm{AbelianVar}_S(k,B,m_B,i_B,e_B)\\land\\mathrm{Morphism}_S(h,A,B,\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(h,A,B)\\land\\mathrm{GroupHomomorphism}_S(h,A,m_A,B,m_B)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}albanese-map} \\vdash \\mathrm{AlbaneseMap}_S(k,X,P_X,n_X,\\tau_X,x_0,A,m_A,i_A,e_A,a,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{ProjectiveVariety}_S(X;P_X,k,n_X,\\tau_X)\\land x_0\\in X\\land\\mathrm{AbelianVar}_S(k,A,m_A,i_A,e_A)\\land\\mathrm{Morphism}_S(a,X,A,\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(a,X,A)\\land a(x_0)=e_A\\land\\forall B,m_B,i_B,e_B,f\\;\\left((\\mathrm{AbelianVar}_S(k,B,m_B,i_B,e_B)\\land\\mathrm{Morphism}_S(f,X,B,\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,B)\\land f(x_0)=e_B)\\to\\exists!h\\;(\\mathrm{AbelianVarHom}_S(h,k,A,m_A,i_A,e_A,B,m_B,i_B,e_B,\\mathcal C)\\land f=h\\circ a)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"H^0(X,\\Omega^1)^*/H_1(X,\\mathbb Z)","display":false}],"bytes":2918,"backlinks":[{"id":"3311bfe05245f437","anchor":"re